.* QUIABOUT: About QS/400, reached from the Information Assistant
.* (F13 on MAIN, then F14): the operating system's product, release
.* and build as DSPSFWRSC lists them, the serial number (QSRLNBR) and
.* the machine's model as its firmware names it. QMODEL and QPRCFEAT
.* stay system values for programs; this panel does not show them.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PRODUCT CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PRDTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RELEASE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=BUILD CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SYSNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=SERIAL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=MODEL CLASS=TEXTCL.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/KEYS' NAME=KEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=EXIT.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=ABOUT KEYL=KEYS HELP=ABOUTH TOPSEP=SYSNAM.About QS/400
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAGRP.Operating system
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRDTEXT' VAR=PRDTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRODUCT' VAR=PRODUCT USAGE=OUTPUT.Product identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/RELEASE' VAR=RELEASE USAGE=OUTPUT.Release
:DATAI HELP='FLD/BUILD' VAR=BUILD USAGE=OUTPUT.Build
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.
:DATAGRP.This system
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SYSNAME' VAR=SYSNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.System name
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SERIAL' VAR=SERIAL USAGE=OUTPUT.Serial number
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MODEL' VAR=MODEL USAGE=OUTPUT.Model
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=ABOUTH.About QS/400 - Help
:P.QS/400 is Quartz Systems' operating system for the midrange way of
working: the same commands, displays and programs, on a machine of
today. This display names the release this system runs and the build
it came from, which Quartz Systems asks for with any report of a
problem, and the serial number and model the system calls itself.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/KEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRDTEXT'.Product
:P.A licensed program by its seven-character product identifier, 5770SS1
for example.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRODUCT'.Product identifier
:P.A product identifier&colon. seven characters, 5770SS1 for example.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RELEASE'.Release
:P.A release, in the form VxRyMz.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/BUILD'.Build
:P.The build shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SYSNAME'.System name
:P.The system name shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SERIAL'.Serial number
:P.The serial number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MODEL'.Model
:P.The model shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
